{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066209/block/singleImage/3280810/wm/01M8D2T3X6WBTMGS9N9GQK90Q6.JPG?updatedAt=1795832055\"/><figcaption>天文台表示，周六大致天晴及非常乾燥。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>天文台表示，周六（27日）大致天晴及非常乾燥，東北季候風正為華南帶來晴朗的天氣，今早本港大部分地區的相對濕度下降至百分之40左右。最高氣溫約27度，吹和緩北至東北風，初時離岸風勢清勁，高地達強風程度。 天文台展望隨後兩三日大致天晴，周日（28日）風勢頗大，下周中後期日間相當溫暖。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066209/block/singleImage/3280812/df/01M8FYV9111H3192H625V223TM.png?updatedAt=1795832055\"/><figcaption>天文台展望隨後兩三日大致天晴</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T03:44:13.559845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T02:14:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:57:24.069009+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T03:37:26.930666+00:00","content_hash":"178d5f53818845c75387004639ff8fbe063ab4127e66e4452754b2d45c6ddfa5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T03:44:13.559845+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}